  "scope": "Share the positive-order square magnitude argument by swapping signed-pair components",
  "validation": "Paired target and three tracked direct Lean clients pass; client object hashes match, and all 65 target names/type/axiom reports and global simp/instance reports match. Six external direct source/object pairs match prior successful producer receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "Earlier CarrierRadix builds used an older RadixAlignment object without a current-source producer match; retained initial records and logs document them, but their objects were overwritten. Final paired client replays use adopted source-matched RadixAlignment.",
    "The FirstIndex historical producer used an older FirstNorm source/object; present transitive inputs were not individually pinned at build time. Project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure remains cached.",
    "Matching reports do not establish equality of proof bodies, all persistent extensions or untested downstream behavior. A single shared-load timing pair does not determine performance reliably.",
    "Two failed exploratory probes lack full input pins; an initial author audit path-error traceback was not retained. Compiled objects are excluded; external objects are needed to independently recheck their recorded hashes."
  ],
